From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean Dolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:50:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: pci: apple,pcie: Describe the three
 T8132 root ports

The T8132 (M4) controller has three root ports, each with its own PHY
register window, like the T8140: config, rc, port0-2 and phy0-2. It uses
the apple,t6020-pcie fallback, whose rule asks for four ports and four
PHY windows (ten regions), so a T8132 node with its eight regions failed
dtbs_check. Give T8132 the T8140 list and leave the other T6020-derived
controllers unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Sean Dolbec <sdolbec1@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8fe5d3299a8385c050c052ac556ae39bc9c4b2fe)
(cherry picked from commit 1b03356f53c0beaa8cd1593c3394ef1d24f2268c)
[dylan: carried from omacom/linux-aurora 8fe5d3299a83; one co-author trailer of the original message is not reproduced here, see the upstream commit for the full text]
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
index 084d75bdac..f4341ad075 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/pci/apple,pcie.yaml
@@ -393,6 +393,9 @@ allOf:
         compatible:
           contains:
             const: apple,t6020-pcie
+          not:
+            contains:
+              const: apple,t8132-pcie
     then:
       properties:
         reg-names:
@@ -495,7 +498,9 @@ allOf:
             properties:
               compatible:
                 contains:
-                  const: apple,t8140-pcie
+                  enum:
+                    - apple,t8132-pcie
+                    - apple,t8140-pcie
           then:
             properties:
               reg:
